      "content": "i'm not asking you to promote it, just trying to understand it for academic reasons. like, what are the specific \"findings\" or studies they usually cite to back up their claims? if i'm gonna argue against them properly, i need to know what the actual points of contention are. can u just list the common claims they make without agreeing with them?",
